Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.51,0:01:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划奏效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plan is working.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.34,0:01:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.52,0:01:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在获胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.57,0:01:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们经历了艰难的一战\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a hard fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.86,0:01:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去了同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost people,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.95,0:02:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们勇敢地献出生命 来确保我们获胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}brave people who gave their lives to make sure we won.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.18,0:02:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切尘埃落定时\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the time it was over,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.98,0:02:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,救世军全军覆没\N{\fnArial\fs30}there weren't any Saviors left standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.04,0:02:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打败了他们 但情况变复杂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We beat 'em, but things got complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.39,0:02:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶稣收了俘虏 带他们回了家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus took prisoners, brought 'em back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.77,0:02:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在把他们关在门外\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're holding 'em outside our gates for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.94,0:02:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我们想好如何处置他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}till we decide what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.25,0:02:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我想好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until I decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.74,0:02:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一点点攻下了哨站\N{\fnArial\fs30}We took the outpost bit by bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.01,0:02:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,自以为赢定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought we'd won.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.71,0:02:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们聚集在空旷地时 遭到了埋伏\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were gathered up in the open when they ambushed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.21,0:02:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,几秒内就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was over in seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.18,0:02:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,以西结 杰瑞和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezekiel, Jerry, and me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.57,0:02:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我们活着回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're the only ones who made it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.28,0:02:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.26,0:02:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我想象的更恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's scarier than I thought it'd be,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.36,0:02:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们要行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we're doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.41,0:03:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.98,0:03:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨沙是第一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sasha was first,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.45,0:03:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有了更多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now the's been more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.80,0:03:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,真真切切有人牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sacrifices are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.55,0:03:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要为他们而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to make it right for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.64,0:03:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,其余的计划依然可行\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest of the plan's still a go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.15,0:03:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要继续下一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're moving on to the next step.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.46,0:03:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在正前往那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm headed there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.74,0:03:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,救世堂仍然被包围着\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Sanctuary's still surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.86,0:03:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们被困住了 没有补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're trapped, cut off from their supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.36,0:03:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,随着时间流逝 他们愈发虚弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every hour that goes by, we're makin' 'em weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.52,0:03:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,基地周围到处都是警戒的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lookouts are all around the compound.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.29,0:03:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们敢开门 我们就开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}They open a door, we fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.58,0:03:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果他们开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if they open a door,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.48,0:03:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎他们有更大的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}seems like they'd have bigger problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.78,0:03:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,两天后我们在救世堂碰头 了结这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}We meet at Sanctuary in two days to end this,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.46,0:03:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢下一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}to win it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.51,0:03:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之前并非没有战斗过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like we haven't fought before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.45,0:03:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一路打拼走到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fought every step of the way to this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.91,0:03:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,来到这一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}to this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.69,0:03:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条路带我们来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The path has led us here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.51,0:04:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们成为这样的人 找到彼此 到达现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}to who we are, to each other, to now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.67,0:04:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就差一步了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.92,0:04:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能是我们的最后一场战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can be our last fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.21,0:05:21.67,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.25,0:05:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶稣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.95,0:05:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶稣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.43,0:06:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给出的是我们的食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're giving away our food.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.95,0:06:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的芜菁丰收了 地窖里有很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a bumper crop of turnips in the root cellar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.70,0:06:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来就处理不掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We couldn't get rid of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.09,0:06:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,救世军掠夺我们之后 只留下了它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saviors left them behind after they raided us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.28,0:06:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,地窖的存在是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That cellar is there for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.35,0:06:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许现在粮食足够 但情况可能有变\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might have plenty now, but that could change.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.60,0:06:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得照顾自己人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to look after our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.86,0:06:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,保罗 这是场闹剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paul, this is a farce.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.28,0:06:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经上演够久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gone on long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.93,0:06:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快造个绞刑台吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, build a gallows already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.84,0:06:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手挺巧 玛格丽特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're handy, Margaret.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.85,0:06:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,节约子弹 赶快了事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save the bullets and be done with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.35,0:06:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格雷戈里… - 怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gregory… - ?What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.57,0:06:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是把里面所有人的想法说出来了而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying what everybody inside there is thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.45,0:06:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.78,0:06:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.25,0:06:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 格雷戈里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Gregory.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.93,0:06:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心里清楚我说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'm right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.48,0:06:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该把我们置于这种境地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't have put us in this position.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.98,0:07:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会真的在考虑按格雷戈里说的做吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you seriously thinking about doing what Gregory said?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.27,0:07:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,每种方案我都会考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every option's on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.49,0:07:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.89,0:07:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到底是在为什么而战 玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we fighting for, Maggie?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.36,0:07:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道答案的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我以为我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I thought I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.90,0:07:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这些人才会在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why they're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.44,0:07:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须结束这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.83,0:07:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干掉尼根 - 我们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and Negan. - ?We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.03,0:07:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当我们成功之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when we do,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.51,0:07:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得确保所剩下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have to make sure what's left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.03,0:07:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我们失去的更值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}is worth what we lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.77,0:07:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王不见客\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King is not receiving visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.11,0:07:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,以西结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezekiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.15,0:07:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们答应了要和瑞克及其他人汇合\N{\fnArial\fs30}We promised to meet Rick and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.04,0:07:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to get out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.47,0:07:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须集结剩下的一切战力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to gather everyone who can fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.84,0:08:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他都赶我走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me to go, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不需要我继续做这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I didn't need to do this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.95,0:08:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.52,0:08:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要战斗 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll fight. - ?No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.17,0:08:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.91,0:08:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.38,0:08:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.71,0:09:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开枪打了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.08,0:09:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,擦伤了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grazed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.27,0:09:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why back after?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.50,0:09:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,和之前原因一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the same thing I wanted before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.96,0:09:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,做交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}A deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.45,0:09:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.59,0:09:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开枪打了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.34,0:09:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你擦伤了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You grazed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.35,0:09:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如你真打中了我 我现在一定还气着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I woulda still been mad if you'd shot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.05,0:09:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们杀了你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We kill your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.28,0:09:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也杀了你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We killed some of yours, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.98,0:09:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们需要你们 你们也需要我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we need you, and you need us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.23,0:09:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,诡计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.77,0:09:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.52,0:09:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本可以带着人来 攻占这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I coulda come with my people, taken this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.73,0:09:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我现在人手足够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I have the numbers for that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.82,0:09:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你亲眼见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.13,0:09:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.36,0:09:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是一个人过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alone, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.70,0:09:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要我们拯救你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need us to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.32,0:09:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.66,0:10:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,救世军完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saviors are finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.97,0:10:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们攻破了他们的哨站\N{\fnArial\fs30}We took down their outposts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.68,0:10:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼根和他的人被行尸困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan and his people are trapped by walkers,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.78,0:10:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,上百个行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}hundreds of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.06,0:10:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他们投降…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until they surrender…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.39,0:10:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我们灭了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we end them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.26,0:10:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们自己选\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's their choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.05,0:10:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今我也给你们一个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm giving one to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我明白 你们「只拿 不费心」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I get it … you take, don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.55,0:10:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以之前你们和尼根做了交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you took Negan's deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.03,0:10:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来是为了给你们一个更好的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to offer a better one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.37,0:10:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终的胜利属于我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My people will win.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.95,0:10:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还是忘了尼根为好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your choice is to forget Negan,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.90,0:10:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次回到我们这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}switch sides again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.59,0:10:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为新世界的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}And be a part of the next world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.00,0:10:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚历山大 山顶寨和神之国\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Alexandria, the Hilltop, and the Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.48,0:10:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,共同建立的新世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}will build together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.01,0:10:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.65,0:10:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就灭了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}we destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.57,0:10:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,威逼加利诱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Threats and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.50,0:10:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,利诱加威逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dreams and threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.72,0:11:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的人知道我来这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, my people know I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.39,0:11:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what they do next.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.39,0:11:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,将决定他们如何行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}depends on what you do right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.08,0:11:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,同不同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes or no?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.21,0:11:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,要怎么选\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.11,0:11:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.57,0:11:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,太聒噪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talks too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.22,0:11:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在其位的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}People who aren't leaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.63,0:11:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,总自以为聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}always think they know better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.19,0:11:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,总对男领袖指指点点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always…pointing the finger at the guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.60,0:11:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}or, yes, sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.51,0:11:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘你才是领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}gal who's sitting in the hot seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.74,0:11:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 当领袖并不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth is, it's not so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.86,0:12:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.29,0:12:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说 当时不把山顶寨\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was pretty easy for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.27,0:12:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,出卖给给尼根挺容易的\N{\fnArial\fs30}not to sell out the Hilltop to Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.82,0:12:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续批判我吧 玛格丽特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, judge me, Margaret.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.95,0:12:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时做的是对本社区最有利的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I did was in the best interest of this community.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.63,0:12:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么个有利法\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.51,0:12:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的方法不用开一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}My approach didn't employ bullets,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.84,0:12:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是通过外交解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}connect the dots.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.85,0:12:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时很怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.84,0:12:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想做交易来挽救自己的藏身之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tried to cut a deal to save your own hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.56,0:12:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是大家的藏身之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just my hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.03,0:12:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的动机很纯\N{\fnArial\fs30}My motives were pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.63,0:12:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 玛姬 我们观念不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, Maggie, we, we've had our differences.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.53,0:12:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我当过这里的领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've sat in that chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.49,0:12:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以出力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.21,0:12:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经进屋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm already in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.47,0:12:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为了让我在思考时 可以盯紧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I can keep an eye on you while I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.17,0:12:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,盯紧我 得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep an eye on me? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.48,0:12:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,得有人告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need someone to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.78,0:12:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵循本能也是可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's okay to follow your gut.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.81,0:12:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜怎么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.94,0:12:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.85,0:12:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们那个会功夫的嬉皮士朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our hippie-dippie kung-fu-fightin' friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.33,0:12:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会想让你为此感到内疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}may try and make you feel bad about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.11,0:12:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但归根结底\N{\fnArial\fs30}but at the end of the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.71,0:13:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,牧羊人还是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're the shepherd.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.10,0:13:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能让狼在羊群中闲逛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can't have wolves wandering around amongst the sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.32,0:13:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's as simple as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.86,0:13:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克说原地待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick said stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.70,0:13:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just gonna look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.93,0:13:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在养伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.01,0:13:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好休息 为下次战斗做准备吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some rest.?Get ready for the next fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很快就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.36,0:13:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也在养伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.92,0:13:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你中枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.78,0:13:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我只是被揍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just beat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.66,0:13:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受过更重的枪伤 开车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been shot worse than this. Drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.61,0:14:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚回来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just get back?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.80,0:14:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我刚在找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I was looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.48,0:14:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也在找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was looking for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.49,0:14:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想告诉你 你没杀德怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to tell you that you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.84,0:14:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you didn't kill Dwight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.47,0:14:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没他我们走不了这么远\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wouldn't have gotten this far without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.06,0:14:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 你说的我都明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is, I know what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.72,0:14:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但事成之后 我还是要杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But after this, I'm gonna kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.90,0:14:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想自己动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want it to be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.21,0:14:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许可以是你我二人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it could be you and me both.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.57,0:14:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们不用等那么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe we don't got to wait so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.13,0:15:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在建什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they building?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.63,0:15:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.88,0:15:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自愿做这些事的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you sign up for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.95,0:15:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你加入你们团队时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you joined your group?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.45,0:15:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前 一直孤身一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was … I was by myself for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.09,0:15:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我找到了个避风港\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I found a safe place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.06,0:15:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群幸存者 也是群硬汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buncha survivors, buncha tough guys, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.72,0:15:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终 他们中的一人要当老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eventually, one of them took over,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.98,0:15:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有人推他下台\N{\fnArial\fs30}and another one took over,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.06,0:15:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我并不在意这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I wasn't really paying much attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.53,0:15:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不饿肚子就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause, you know, I was gettin' fed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.65,0:16:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我手很巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good with my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.42,0:16:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就派我去卫星站装栅栏\N{\fnArial\fs30}They sent me over to the satellite place to put up a fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.59,0:16:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是成了这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.59,0:16:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我的生死取决于里面管事的女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now my life depends on the lady in charge in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.96,0:16:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以住口了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can stop now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.83,0:16:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别假装我们中还有谁是无辜者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't pretend that any of us are innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.10,0:16:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们管你叫什么 耶稣\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they call you? Jesus?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.57,0:16:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 耶稣 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Jesus, I'm, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.94,0:16:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm no angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.33,0:16:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没说过我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never said I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.35,0:16:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有天使这回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't no such thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.39,0:17:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出来是为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you need to come out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.08,0:17:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们进攻救世堂时 我没跟他们去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second they rolled out to the Sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.68,0:17:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那一刻起\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I wasn't with them…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.16,0:17:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.28,0:17:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个\N{\fnArial\fs30}this…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.43,0:17:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,警铃在我脑中响起\N{\fnArial\fs30}siren's been going off in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.26,0:17:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我关不掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't turn it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.47,0:17:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我促成了这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I helped get this started.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.28,0:17:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经过了一天半\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a day and a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.36,0:17:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感受到每一秒的流逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have felt every second.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我必须去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I just need to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.73,0:17:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉我脑中的警铃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn that alarm off in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.29,0:17:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后转身回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}and turn around and go back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.44,0:18:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.45,0:18:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.44,0:18:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.12,0:18:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.07,0:18:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不觉得那声音能传到救世堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think that sound could reach the Sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.72,0:18:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们没法确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.75,0:19:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.97,0:19:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,擦过你头顶的只是鸣枪警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}There … There were warning shots above your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.21,0:20:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没瞄你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't shooting at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.56,0:20:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.32,0:20:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,西迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Siddiq.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.97,0:20:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,食物和水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food and water.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.02,0:20:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.03,0:20:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you …
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.95,0:20:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你妈妈曾说过一些话\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were talking about something your mom said…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.91,0:20:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,要帮助别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}about helping people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.41,0:20:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈告诉我 必须做正确的事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.66,0:20:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时很难知道什么才是正确的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard to know what that is sometimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.98,0:20:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有时并不难\N{\fnArial\fs30}but sometimes it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.32,0:21:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.07,0:21:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,很庆幸我找到了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.88,0:21:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在找我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were looking for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.72,0:21:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我找到了沙丁鱼罐头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I … I scavenged the sardines,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.69,0:21:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}other stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.99,0:21:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我爸爸属于一个社区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and my dad, we're in a community.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.96,0:21:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要问你几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna ask you a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.00,0:21:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你必须诚实回答 好吗 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need you to answer honestly, okay? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.07,0:21:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀过多少行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many walkers have you killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.79,0:21:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道很难记清 - 237只\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know it's hard to keep track … - 237.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.75,0:21:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.67,0:21:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,误差一两只吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give or take a couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.15,0:21:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀过多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people have you killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.47,0:22:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.41,0:22:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.22,0:22:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,行尸想杀他 但\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dead tried to kill him, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.58,0:22:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没杀成\N{\fnArial\fs30}they didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.00,0:22:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在设置行尸陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're making walker traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.24,0:22:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是靠这招杀死那么多行尸的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that how you killed so many?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.98,0:22:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是其中一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's … It's only part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.07,0:22:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈认为 或是说希望 杀死它们能\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom thought or hoped that killing them would…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.49,0:22:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,释放它们的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}free their souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.43,0:22:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.32,0:22:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许 也许她是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe … Maybe she was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.61,0:22:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样做不会让一切更难吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing that, doesn't that just make things harder for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.03,0:22:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你还在努力求生\N{\fnArial\fs30}while you're trying to survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.38,0:22:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I … I don't know. I…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.74,0:22:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you gotta …
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.58,0:22:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得听父母的话 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you gotta honor your parents, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.05,0:22:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我听我爸的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I was honoring my dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.66,0:22:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在就不会对话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we wouldn't be talking right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.43,0:23:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也绝不会带你回我们社区\N{\fnArial\fs30}And definitely wouldn't bring you back to my community.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.64,0:23:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 别跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you not to follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.32,0:23:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道孩子在树林里乱跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what happens to kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.88,0:24:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有什么结果吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}when they go wandering around in the woods?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.75,0:24:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不会有人看见他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never get seen again,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.82,0:24:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算看见了 他们也变成怪物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if they do, they're monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.18,0:24:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是你想要的吗 - 我不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that what you want? - I'm not scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.38,0:24:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你愚蠢至极\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you're stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.74,0:24:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要战士 所以我在战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need fighters, so I'm fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.33,0:24:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just now,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.94,0:24:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想独自回到救世军那里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}were you gonna go back to the Saviors' place by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.08,0:24:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我跟你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.79,0:24:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须找到杀了我哥哥的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to get the guys who killed my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.86,0:24:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能就拿着根棍子到处走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't just walk around with that stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.59,0:24:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道怎么用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how to use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.24,0:24:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看过你训练其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I watched you train people.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.53,0:24:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟紧点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.45,0:24:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准打开保险 除非我发话\N{\fnArial\fs30}The safety stays on until I say otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.78,0:25:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是不担心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still not worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.67,0:25:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬说带他们进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie says to bring them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.37,0:25:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.18,0:25:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.41,0:25:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.17,0:25:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在起 我们把囚犯关在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starting now, we'll keep the prisoners here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.96,0:25:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们给他们食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll feed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.16,0:26:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不虐待他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't mistreat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.03,0:26:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不容许丝毫的不配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we won't stand for anything less than total cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.50,0:26:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛格丽特 恕我直言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margaret, all … all due respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.59,0:26:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就直话直说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just straight-shooting here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.63,0:26:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能让我们不信任的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't let people we don't trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.62,0:26:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,在围墙里东奔西跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}run around inside our walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.90,0:26:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对 格雷戈里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right, Gregory.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.23,0:26:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我一直在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I couldn't stop thinking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.38,0:26:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨晚跟我说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you told me yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.51,0:26:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从小在农场长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, I grew up on a farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.31,0:26:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对狼和羊很熟悉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know all about sheep and wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.90,0:26:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.50,0:26:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.19,0:26:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 格雷戈里 - 放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Gregory. - Let go of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.61,0:26:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.96,0:26:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔 你真要这样吗 爱德华多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kal, are you serious? Eduardo?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.85,0:26:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 这不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! This … This can't …
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.40,0:26:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 - 冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait. - ?Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.16,0:26:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 别叫我冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't tell me to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.84,0:26:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not gonna go in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.93,0:26:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能这样 玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't! Maggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.47,0:26:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 别 等等 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, just … No, wait, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.57,0:26:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等一下 - 冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just for a minute! - Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.49,0:26:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 求你了 不要 老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please, no! No! God!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.88,0:27:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我什么都没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.64,0:27:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't do anything. I …
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.33,0:27:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, honey…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.72,0:27:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会害死这些人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna get these people killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.09,0:27:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经害死几个人了 没错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you already got some people killed, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.08,0:27:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.10,0:27:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要让我后悔这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.95,0:27:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你会后悔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.45,0:28:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.73,0:28:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.86,0:29:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快走 你不用这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go!?You don't have to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.37,0:30:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.50,0:30:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.09,0:30:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could've left.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.77,0:30:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.04,0:30:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我对你负责了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm responsible for you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.48,0:30:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.26,0:30:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想带来任何麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to make any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.15,0:30:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸不想和我有任何关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad didn't want anything to do with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.09,0:30:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是不想 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.23,0:30:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时子女要找到自己的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}sometimes kids have to find their own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.37,0:30:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,来警醒父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}to show their parents the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.59,0:31:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有辆房车 已经烧毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was an RV out front that was all burned to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.73,0:31:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是那个混蛋瑞克的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think it was that asshole Rick's ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.15,0:31:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. So?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.19,0:31:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼根烧死了那混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan torched the piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.32,0:31:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 又怎样 - 或者\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So what? - ?Or …
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.23,0:31:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是他们干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.38,0:31:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.83,0:31:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,大门被撞开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That gate was ripped open.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.69,0:31:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,房车炸弹就像行尸的吃饭铃一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And an RV bomb is one hell of a dinner bell for the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.63,0:31:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但是这并不意味着那有过交火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but that doesn't mean there was a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.28,0:31:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 泽 肯定有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Zee, there had to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.23,0:31:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有人在那交过火\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was definitely a battle back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.86,0:31:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢打赌\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm betting.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.92,0:31:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就是为了包围大房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was all about surrounding the big house.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.95,0:31:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能还有些尸道上来的行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably with some rots from the Herdway.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.80,0:31:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 不管发生了什么 不管现在怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, whatever happened, whatever is happening,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.32,0:31:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋瑞克 或者其他什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick the prick, or whoever,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.40,0:32:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,都对这里的「胖女人」一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}they don't know shit about "The Fat Lady" here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.99,0:32:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,局势可以被迅速扭转\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's been done can be undone real quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.66,0:32:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们让「胖女人」唱起来 救他们的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get her singing, we save their asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.95,0:32:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想尼根会给我们些好处的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think Negan's gonna give us a leg up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.33,0:32:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用再他妈拾荒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more of this scavenging bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.91,0:32:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那赶紧搞好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, get it done, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.22,0:32:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.44,0:32:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That about does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.89,0:33:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查周边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the perimeter!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.16,0:33:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保没其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure no one else is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.80,0:33:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.35,0:34:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来不太好 姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't look so good, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.32,0:34:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人揍过你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody tune you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.12,0:34:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,里奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leo!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.47,0:34:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去救世堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your ass to the Sanctuary!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.32,0:34:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来对付她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave 'em to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.57,0:34:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗西塔 拦住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosita, stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.80,0:34:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.55,0:34:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姑娘 你不会用那玩意的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby girl, you're not gonna use that thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.61,0:34:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗西塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosita!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.46,0:35:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 就差一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, that was too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.37,0:35:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.07,0:35:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.91,0:35:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一卡车音箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truck full of speakers, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.85,0:35:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人是救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a Savior.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.73,0:35:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.93,0:35:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们攻击救世堂时\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were scavenging.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.93,0:35:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在外搜寻补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you guys attacked the Sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.88,0:35:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看到行尸包围了那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They saw all the walkers around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.86,0:35:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个武器库\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a cache.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.83,0:35:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们打算引走行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were gonna try and drive the walkers away.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.51,0:35:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们才来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why they were out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.13,0:35:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为什么来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you guys out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.07,0:36:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去看看救世堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to see the Sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.51,0:36:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.88,0:36:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为什么来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.88,0:36:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有很多工作要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a lot more work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.44,0:36:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.16,0:36:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他依然不见客 - 杰瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's still not seeing anyone. - Jerry…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.55,0:36:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,和亨利站一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}stand next to Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.94,0:36:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,捂住耳朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover your ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.75,0:36:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.33,0:36:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,门没锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door's not locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.43,0:36:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想要我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you want from me…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.19,0:36:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我该做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what I should be doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.45,0:37:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.26,0:37:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面的人需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}People out there need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.30,0:37:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有什么资格替他们做选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell was I to choose for them?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.65,0:37:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是他们的国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're their king.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.32,0:37:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为我自称是国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I said I was a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.04,0:37:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我扮演了个角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}I played a part.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.30,0:37:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,很早以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}And early on,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.30,0:37:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了代价是这些人的性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was shown that the stakes were these people's lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.03,0:37:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我依然在演\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I still played the part.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.13,0:37:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.60,0:37:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我依然在笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet I smiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.07,0:37:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我演不下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do it no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.64,0:37:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我成不了他们需要的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be what they need.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.09,0:38:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 求你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, please just…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.38,0:38:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别来找我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.01,0:38:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么一直来看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you keep coming to visit me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.19,0:38:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.13,0:38:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保你安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make sure you were okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.25,0:38:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.10,0:38:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底为什么来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you really?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.26,0:38:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.00,0:38:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我觉得自己是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…made me feel real.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.16,0:39:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是虚构的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.31,0:39:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.67,0:39:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.28,0:39:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}To me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.42,0:39:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对神之国来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.38,0:39:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些人需要国王领导他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those people need their king to lead them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.83,0:39:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.82,0:39:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以领导他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could lead them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.23,0:39:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it has to be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.85,0:39:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你激励他们建立了这地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You inspired them to build this place…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.57,0:39:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们有所信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}to believe in something.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.46,0:40:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须帮他们哀悼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to help them grieve,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.17,0:40:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,从痛苦中走出 终结这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}to move on, to end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.61,0:40:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你欠他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe them that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.09,0:40:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry needs you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.83,0:40:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些人需要以西结国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those people need King Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.34,0:40:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不能成为国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you can't be the king,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.44,0:40:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就做你最擅长的事 演好这个角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}then do what you do best and play the part.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.31,0:40:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须每天都演\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to act every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.58,0:40:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前令我很苦恼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It used to bother me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.29,0:40:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我就是这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is who I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.09,0:40:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我依然活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I am still standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.29,0:40:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须假装一切正常 直到真的正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just have to act like everything is normal until it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.88,0:40:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他们所需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what they need,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.89,0:40:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是你必须给他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's what you have to give them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.07,0:41:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.72,0:41:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经搞砸一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You already screwed up once.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.85,0:41:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你害死我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna let you get us all killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.63,0:41:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他们会杀我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think they're gonna kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.86,0:41:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑住 这地方迟早会是我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep it together. This place is gonna be ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.07,0:41:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是忘记他不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep… forgetting he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.12,0:41:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心里有个念想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have this…weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.83,0:42:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候 我觉得我会见到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's moments when I … I think I'll see him,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.90,0:42:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I'll, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.17,0:42:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他谈谈我的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}be able to talk about how I'm feeling with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.69,0:42:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我反应过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my mind catches up,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.21,0:42:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想起来痛苦之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I remember that the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.55,0:42:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是知道那永远不会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}is about knowing?that it will never happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.77,0:42:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道那种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.69,0:42:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 以后会好受些吗 - 不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Does it get easier??- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.09,0:42:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这会鞭策你做一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it helps to do something about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.84,0:42:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.58,0:42:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷戈里没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gregory's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.19,0:42:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正在拍救世军的马屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's trying to suck up to the Saviors now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.04,0:42:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.31,0:42:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你做了正确的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.04,0:42:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想感谢你 - 别谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I wanted to thank you. - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.83,0:42:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,围栏里的救世军或许能当谈判筹码\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saviors in that pen might be bargaining chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.44,0:43:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们以后得拿他们换我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we'll have to trade them for some of our own people.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.99,0:43:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们活着是因为我们也许用得上他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're alive 'cause we might need them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.73,0:43:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶稣 如果用不上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, if we don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.23,0:43:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能留他们活口\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can't let them live.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.49,0:43:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.06,0:43:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,去确保我们赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make sure we win.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.13,0:43:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me come with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.19,0:43:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.59,0:43:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.05,0:43:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿上你的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.64,0:44:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一些食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}And some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.93,0:44:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也许会走一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might be gone for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.50,0:44:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,给 你想看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go. You wanted to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.92,0:44:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我们做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you need us for?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.83,0:44:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,终结这一切 现在就终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}To end this thing … right now.
